WEBVTT

00:00:03.413 --> 00:00:05.680
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What time do you get up in the morning?

00:00:06.376 --> 00:00:09.173
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> I usually get up at about seven.

00:00:09.770 --> 00:00:16.536
That way I have time to exercise or go for a run, or even play squash before breakfast.

00:00:17.470 --> 00:00:19.590
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What do you have for breakfast?

00:00:20.793 --> 00:00:25.100
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> Cereal and milk, and toast with honey or jam.

00:00:26.101 --> 00:00:28.233
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you have classes every day?

00:00:28.894 --> 00:00:32.956
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> I have lectures in the morning every day except Friday.

00:00:33.606 --> 00:00:39.880
Lectures are classes for everybody who studies politics. Some of those are online.

00:00:40.692 --> 00:00:45.993
Then I also have tutorials on Thursday afternoon and Friday morning.

00:00:46.592 --> 00:00:49.805
Tutorials are small face-to-face classes.

00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:54.983
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> And what do you do when you don’t have lectures or tutorials?

00:00:55.697 --> 00:00:57.137
Is that free time?

00:00:57.711 --> 00:01:01.223
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> No, I study! I have exams soon.

00:01:01.832 --> 00:01:05.266
I work in my room or I go to the university library.

00:01:06.275 --> 00:01:08.026
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Where do you have lunch?

00:01:08.649 --> 00:01:13.466
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> I usually have lunch at the university at about one o’clock,

00:01:13.980 --> 00:01:17.616
but sometimes I just have a sandwich in a café in town.

00:01:18.639 --> 00:01:21.737
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do you go out in the evening during the week?

00:01:22.336 --> 00:01:25.193
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> Well, music is my main hobby.

00:01:26.048 --> 00:01:30.673
I’m in the university choir and I sing every evening from 6 to 7.

00:01:31.406 --> 00:01:34.646
I also play percussion in the university orchestra.

00:01:35.694 --> 00:01:38.638
After choir, I sometimes go out with friends,

00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:42.090
or we watch a movie, especially on weekends.

00:01:42.861 --> 00:01:45.596
But I often need to study in the evenings, too.

00:01:46.611 --> 00:01:48.060
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Where do you have dinner?

00:01:48.872 --> 00:01:54.479
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> Sometimes I go to a restaurant with my friends, but usually I eat at the university.

00:01:55.235 --> 00:01:57.383
The food is actually pretty good.

00:01:58.157 --> 00:02:01.878
A lot of my friends cook, but I’m terrible at cooking.

00:02:02.995 --> 00:02:05.192
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> What time do you go to bed?

00:02:05.924 --> 00:02:11.144
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> At about eleven. I’m usually so tired I go to sleep right away.

00:02:11.743 --> 00:02:17.572
It’s my last year, so all I really do these days is study, eat, and sleep.

00:02:18.791 --> 00:02:20.934
<v><b>Interviewer:</b></v> Do your parents come and visit you?

00:02:21.655 --> 00:02:25.143
<v><b>Darius:</b></v> My mother comes about once or twice a term.

00:02:25.709 --> 00:02:30.537
But I prefer to go home and see her there because I’m very messy,

00:02:31.039 --> 00:02:35.839
so when she comes to visit, I need to spend the whole day cleaning my room.